#Brayis-prep.lic
#Warrior version of Fizzleworth-prep.lic (Brayis) -- no spellcasting, no
#instrument, no wands, so gearing up for combat is clearing hands, rubbing the
#couple of items he can use without a spellcasting skill, and readying the
#weapon.

module BrayisPrep

# clear hands -- "store 2weap" routes the Claidhmore to the readied sheath per
# the in-game STORE config (STORE SET WEAPON SHEATH); "stow all" mops up
# anything left in the off-hand.
fput "store 2weap"
fput "stow all"

# rub stuff, but only if the spell isn't already active -- and only pause
# after ones that actually ran, instead of always eating 3s per item
unless Spell[1712].active?
  Script.run("qverb", "rub small statue")
  pause 3
end
unless Spell[509].active?
  Script.run("qverb", "rub white crystal")
  pause 3
end

fput "ready 2weap"

end #End of module
